  description: '"Charmer" monsters you control cannot be destroyed by battle. If
    a "Familiar-Possessed" monster you control attacks an opponent''s monster, it
    gains 800 ATK during damage calculation only. If a monster(s) you control is
    destroyed by battle or card effect: You can Special Summon 1 Spellcaster-Type
    monster with 1500 DEF from your Deck, whose Attribute is different from at least
    1 of those destroyed monsters'' original Attributes on the field, in Attack Position
    or face-down Defense Position. You can only use this effect of "Unpossessed"
    once per turn.'
